{
  "name": "SystemArchitecture",
  "internal_name": "SystemArchitecture",
  "focus": "High-level system boundary and interaction flow: lenders and borrowers interact with V3Vault, which accounts for debt, lending shares, and NFT collateral; V3Oracle and InterestRateModel provide valuation and rate calculations; liquidators call vault liquidation directly or through FlashloanLiquidator; approved transformers and automators operate on vault-held or externally owned Uniswap V3 position NFTs; Swapper, Uniswap V3 pools and position manager, Permit2, Chainlink feeds, and token contracts are external dependencies and trust boundaries.",
